From 1155310ffa43983eb4c4aa15f1e8c5cf82eb03bf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 11 Apr 2026 14:47:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/9] ktranslate: add topology neighbor scaffolding
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Introduces the data model, config surface, and poll-loop wiring for
LLDP/CDP-based device-to-device topology discovery. Adds kt.TopologyNeighbor
and kt.NeighborSource, a Neighbors slice on kt.DeviceData, discover_neighbors
and neighbor_protocols knobs on SnmpDeviceConfig, a new KSnmpTopology event
type, and a PollTopology entry point gated off by default.

pollLLDPNeighbors and pollCDPNeighbors are stubbed — the next commits add
the real walks. Neighbors collected this way flow through the existing
metadata JCHF channel, one record per link, so every sink picks them up
with no extra wiring.
